  "brain_first": "“把表格/段落当搜索页面，不要全文精读。”",
  "sort_order": 1017,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 730
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题干锁定具体数字/时间/地点/人物，常见于应用",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 731
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "文、活动信息、说明文。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 732
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 733
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "属于细节题的快速定位版本。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 734
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “把表格/段落当搜索页面，不要全文精读。”",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 735
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这类题的难点常是条件组合：日期+对象+价格，而非英语难度。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 736
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 737
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 圈题干所有条件，例如 student + Saturday + after 6 p.m. 。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 738
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 在文章中先找最稀有条件（专有名词/日期）。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 739
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 找到候选信息后，逐个核对剩余条件。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 740
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 有计算时只做题目需要的最小计算。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 741
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 742
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 743
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 744
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 表格/广告 → 优先看小标题、粗体、价格栏",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 745
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “under 18” ≠ “18 and under”",
      "sourcePage": 27,
      "sourceIndex": 746
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 所有条件同时满足。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 747
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不要因为一个条件匹配就选；用“AND”思维：A且B且C都对。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 748
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 749
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题目问18岁学生周日票价；文章写 Students 16-18: $8 on weekends，则只要身份和日期都符合即可。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 750
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 751
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只核对一个条件。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 752
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看错 inclusive / exclusive 边界。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 753
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 754
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 每个条件都打勾了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 755
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有没有隐藏限制词 only / before / after / except？",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 756
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 757
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 758
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 759
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 具体信息题 = 条件全部对上。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 760
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 762
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 题问“when”，优先圈什么？",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 763
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 题问“who”，原文有两个人名，怎么做？",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 764
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 数字题出现原价和折后价，问paid应取？",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 765
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 地点题出现起点和目的地，问destination应取？",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 766
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 信息题最常见低级错？",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 767
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 时间/日期定位词。；2. 找到与题干事件对应的人，不只看最近人名。；3. 实际支付价。；4. 目的",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 768
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "地。；5. 把相邻但不属于题干对象的信息搬过去。",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 769
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R3 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R3”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 28,
      "sourceIndex": 770
    }
  ],
